#: ../../source/docs/common-djirs2-gimbal.rst:53
#: 5bf0be827b4f485aba8442b9b3808d85 7d3c4a54a18146c0ba4c203563331020
#: cffdd3c5d091498fa7b295058d9a5e0f d68223ae047243bf885ea7e6c35814de
#: d9f8f148c9f9423881c4fabc86445694
msgid ""
"See :ref:`Gimbal / Mount Controls <common-mount-targeting>` for details on "
"how to control the gimbal using RC, GCS or Auto mode mission commands"
msgstr ""
"请参阅 :ref:`Gimbal / Mount Controls <common-mount-targeting>`，了解如何通过 RC、GCS 或 "
"Auto 模式任务命令控制云台的详细信息"

#: ../../source/docs/common-djirs2-gimbal.rst:55
#: 743f6e8b55d5408281b551d2e57b24f7 78450aa2389f41adaad322311a06e10a
#: e3476d11659947b08358ce0e208d0e86 ebcb3c11270048a3919ae02a0fa7431e
#: f2e5892b3e7446c2bc989e23ca7ddee6
msgid ""
"Yaw rate control is always \"follow\" mode (aka \"earth frame\") meaning "
"that if the user control the gimbal's yaw rotation rate from the RC (e.g. "
":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE<MNT1_RC_RATE>` > 0) the gimbal will rotate in \"lock\" "
"mode (e.g. \"earth frame\", e.g. will not rotate with the vehicle). A "
"workaround is to always use yaw angle control (e.g. "
":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE<MNT1_RC_RATE>` = 0) or switch the mount to \"Neutral\" "
"whenever the user wishes to re-center it."
msgstr ""
"偏航速率控制始终为「跟随」模式（即「地球坐标系」）——若用户通过RC控制云台偏航旋转速率（如 "
":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE<MNT1_RC_RATE>` > "
"0），云台将以「锁定」模式旋转（即「地球坐标系」，不随飞行器旋转）。变通方法是始终使用偏航角度控制（如 "
":ref:`MNT1_RC_RATE<MNT1_RC_RATE>` = 0），或在用户希望重新居中时将挂载切换为「Neutral」。"

